        rdfs:label "docs/media/equus_scotti_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png (generated output)" ;
        dct:description "Six-panel pass-2 figure — docs/media/equus_scotti_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-equus-scotti-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 3d4615e96e7fbafcf9d3e24355fcc03695e61f40, image/png, 392198 B, 1584×946 px, artifact_sha256 003c2e77dd423d8d470005fc1556382940fa073d32ddae515bf7997517b03f56 (sha256 003c2e77dd423d8d470005fc1556382940fa073d32ddae515bf7997517b03f56), spec_fingerprint a3ff127a4fbe604c383fca881bbb59ca1298842374b9b9112403cb1ca2e31003" .
