        rdfs:label "docs/media/equus_scotti_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif (generated output)" ;
        dct:description "12-frame growth GIF, 960×649 — docs/media/equus_scotti_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-equus-scotti-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 3d4615e96e7fbafcf9d3e24355fcc03695e61f40, image/gif, 2806694 B, 960×649 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 e1fadb350cf8089397e54ba1e513e482e330c78001de617b0af06aabf3a50b88 (sha256 e1fadb350cf8089397e54ba1e513e482e330c78001de617b0af06aabf3a50b88), spec_fingerprint a3ff127a4fbe604c383fca881bbb59ca1298842374b9b9112403cb1ca2e31003" .
